# This repository has two apps, each with its own environment file.
# This root file only documents where to find them - copy the real
# templates into place before running the app locally:
#
#   backend/.env.example  -> copy to backend/.env
#   frontend/.env.example -> copy to frontend/.env.local
#
# See backend/.env.example for: DATABASE_URL, JWT_SECRET, CORS_ORIGINS,
# COINGECKO_API_BASE, CRYPTOPANIC_API_KEY, OPENROUTER_API_KEY.
#
# See frontend/.env.example for: NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL.
#
# Never commit a real .env or .env.local file - only .env.example files
# with placeholder values belong in Git.
